# Day 6 – Generative AI Learning Journey
**Date:** 21 July 2026

## What I did today
- Compared two versions of the F-347 skill and identified which parts were stronger
- Integrated the system-centric Regulatory Form Filling Framework (v3) into the live F-347 skill
- Fixed a real classification error (Guarantor accounts from CIBIL were being treated as direct liabilities instead of going into A.12)
- Updated the skill with mandatory Identity Resolution, Evidence Mapping, Consistency Validation, and three-part output (Form + Validation Summary + Assumptions)
