## What I learned
- Forms should be the last step, not the starting point
- Identity resolution and evidence mapping must happen before any figure is entered
- CIBIL ownership field (Individual/Joint vs Guarantor) is critical for correct table routing
- Having two parallel skills for the same form creates confusion and must be reconciled

## One small win
